  "description": "Ride ACE01 and start a wild journey! VIVI ACE01 is tailor-made for off-road enthusiasts. Its 1500W peak high-speed motor, 90Nm torque, 48V 15Ah battery and long range will ensure that you have enough power and strength to deal with any obstacles and conquer all terrains with ease. The newly upgraded high-precision torque sensor ensures a smooth and sensitive ride for a more natural riding experience. Embark on an adventure with ACE01 equipped with a torque sensor and experience an unprecedented all-terrain journey.\n\nIntelligent 5 level pedal assist and digital LCD display\n\nSuspension fork with lockout and adjustment, 100mm travel\nHydraulic disc brakes with 180mm rotors\nShimano 7-speed gear system\n54.6V 3Amp smart fast charger\nTop 25Mph and Up to 60 miles of riding range (pedal assist)\n26 × 4.0\" all terrain fat tires\nSGS certified to UL2849 & UL2271 safety standards",
